    "text": "tangent at F&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;yt = c + 4t<sup>2</sup><br />a : x = 0 &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; y = 4t&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(0,4t)<br />(4t<sup>2</sup>,8t) satisfies the line<br />8t = 4mt<sup>2</sup> + 3<br />4mt<sup>2</sup> - 8t + 3 = 0<br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>Area</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtable> <mtr> <mtd> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>3</mn> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mn>0</mn> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>4</mn> <mi>t</mi> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> </mtr> <mtr> <mtd> <mn>4</mn> <msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>8</mn> <mi>t</mi> </mtd> <mtd> <mn>1</mn> </mtd> </mtr> </mtable> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_advanced/EM00012667_AnsExp_1.jpg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 165px;\" /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> <mrow> <mn>2</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>4</mn> <msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mi>t</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <mi>t</mi> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mtext>A</mtext> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mspace></mspace> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mn>3</mn> <msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>-</mo> <mn>4</mn> <msup> <mi>t</mi> <mn>3</mn> </msup> </mrow> </mfenced> </mrow> </math><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>=</mo> <mfrac> <mrow> <mtext>dA</mtext> </mrow> <mrow> <mtext>dt</mtext> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>2</mn> <mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\",\"